    {
      "id": "ev-0747",
      "introduced_at": 144,
      "kind": "event",
      "safe_through": 144,
      "title": "祠堂老人与林惊羽的授业对话",
      "updates": [
        {
          "action_refs": [
            {
              "path": "events/block-0010.json",
              "record_id": "claim-5312"
            },
            {
              "path": "events/block-0010.json",
              "record_id": "claim-5315"
            },
            {
              "path": "events/block-0010.json",
              "record_id": "claim-5318"
            },
            {
              "path": "events/block-0010.json",
              "record_id": "claim-5323"
            },
            {
              "path": "events/block-0010.json",
              "record_id": "claim-5324"
            }
          ],
          "chapter_ranges": [
            {
              "end": 144,
              "start": 144
            }
          ],
          "claims": [
            {
              "attributed_to_ref": null,
              "basis_refs": [],
              "certainty": "explicit",
              "id": "claim-5312",
              "revealed_at": 144,
              "source_refs": [
                {
                  "chapter_id": "ch-000144",
                  "chapter_order": 144,
                  "path": "source/vol-004/ch-000144.txt"
                }
              ],
              "supersedes_refs": [],
              "text": "演练结束后林惊羽从深坑中跃出，满身灰尘，喘息稍定后快步走到祠堂老人身边。"
            },
            {
              "attributed_to_ref": {
                "path": "characters/char-0265/index.json",
                "record_id": "char-0265"
              },
              "basis_refs": [],
              "certainty": "reported",
              "id": "claim-5313",
              "revealed_at": 144,
              "source_refs": [
                {
                  "chapter_id": "ch-000144",
                  "chapter_order": 144,
                  "path": "source/vol-004/ch-000144.txt"
                }
              ],
              "supersedes_refs": [],
              "text": "祠堂老人向林惊羽招手，说「你很好，真的很好」。"
            },
            {
              "attributed_to_ref": {
                "path": "characters/char-0265/index.json",
                "record_id": "char-0265"
              },
              "basis_refs": [],
              "certainty": "reported",
              "id": "claim-5314",
              "revealed_at": 144,
              "source_refs": [
                {
                  "anchor": "也比你快不了多少",
                  "chapter_id": "ch-000144",
                  "chapter_order": 144,
                  "path": "source/vol-004/ch-000144.txt"
                }
              ],
              "supersedes_refs": [],
              "text": "祠堂老人自称：就算是他当年修成这式「斩鬼神」真法剑诀，也快不了林惊羽多少。"
            },
            {
              "attributed_to_ref": {
                "path": "characters/char-0002/index.json",
                "record_id": "char-0002"
              },
              "basis_refs": [],
              "certainty": "reported",
              "id": "claim-5315",
              "revealed_at": 144,
              "source_refs": [
                {
                  "chapter_id": "ch-000144",
                  "chapter_order": 144,
                  "path": "source/vol-004/ch-000144.txt"
                }
              ],
              "supersedes_refs": [],
              "text": "林惊羽对老人说，若不是有他指点，自己不知要到什么时候才能修习这等绝世真法。"
            },
            {
              "attributed_to_ref": {
                "path": "characters/char-0265/index.json",
                "record_id": "char-0265"
              },
              "basis_refs": [],
              "certainty": "reported",
              "id": "claim-5316",
              "revealed_at": 144,
              "source_refs": [
                {
                  "anchor": "也就田不易还有你以前那个师父苍松还算可以",
                  "chapter_id": "ch-000144",
                  "chapter_order": 144,
                  "path": "source/vol-004/ch-000144.txt"
                }
              ],
              "supersedes_refs": [],
              "text": "祠堂老人称，如今青云门中除了道玄之外，只有田不易和林惊羽以前那个师父苍松还算可以，其他长老首座都不成器。"
            },
            {
              "attributed_to_ref": null,
              "basis_refs": [],
              "certainty": "explicit",
              "id": "claim-5317",
              "revealed_at": 144,
              "source_refs": [
                {
                  "anchor": "学艺至今已超过十年",
                  "chapter_id": "ch-000144",
                  "chapter_order": 144,
                  "path": "source/vol-004/ch-000144.txt"
                }
              ],
              "supersedes_refs": [],
              "text": "林惊羽从师这位祠堂老人学艺至今已超过十年，修行每深一分，对老人的钦佩敬慕之心就更深一分。"
            },
            {
              "attributed_to_ref": {
                "path": "characters/char-0002/index.json",
                "record_id": "char-0002"
              },
              "basis_refs": [],
              "certainty": "reported",
              "id": "claim-5318",
              "revealed_at": 144,
              "source_refs": [
                {
                  "anchor": "我看那个田不易稀松平常的紧",
                  "chapter_id": "ch-000144",
                  "chapter_order": 144,
                  "path": "source/vol-004/ch-000144.txt"
                }
              ],
              "supersedes_refs": [],
              "text": "林惊羽对老人说「我看那个田不易稀松平常的紧，有什么了不起的」。"
            },
            {
              "attributed_to_ref": null,
              "basis_refs": [
                {
                  "anchor": "其中只怕还有一些当初看到田不易责骂张小凡的原因",
                  "chapter_id": "ch-000144",
                  "chapter_order": 144,
                  "path": "source/vol-004/ch-000144.txt"
                }
              ],
              "certainty": "uncertain",
              "id": "claim-5319",
              "revealed_at": 144,
              "source_refs": [
                {
                  "chapter_id": "ch-000144",
                  "chapter_order": 144,
                  "path": "source/vol-004/ch-000144.txt"
                }
              ],
              "supersedes_refs": [],
              "text": "林惊羽一向看田不易不顺眼，其原因可能包含当初见到田不易责骂张小凡一事，但原文以「只怕」推测，未确定。"
            },
            {
              "attributed_to_ref": {
                "path": "characters/char-0265/index.json",
                "record_id": "char-0265"
              },
              "basis_refs": [],
              "certainty": "reported",
              "id": "claim-5320",
              "revealed_at": 144,
              "source_refs": [
                {
                  "anchor": "道法修行便一日千里",
                  "chapter_id": "ch-000144",
                  "chapter_order": 144,
                  "path": "source/vol-004/ch-000144.txt"
                }
              ],
              "supersedes_refs": [],
              "text": "祠堂老人称田不易在修道上有另一番天赋、性子坚毅执着，入门后平平无奇，一旦得指点开窍便一日千里，成就反在平日起看不起他的师兄师姐之上。"
            },
            {
              "attributed_to_ref": {
                "path": "characters/char-0265/index.json",
                "record_id": "char-0265"
              },
              "basis_refs": [],
              "certainty": "reported",
              "id": "claim-5321",
              "revealed_at": 144,
              "source_refs": [
                {
                  "anchor": "如以前天云、商正梁一帮废物",
                  "chapter_id": "ch-000144",
                  "chapter_order": 144,
                  "path": "source/vol-004/ch-000144.txt"
                }
              ],
              "supersedes_refs": [],
              "text": "祠堂老人将天云、商正梁等原青云首座称作废物。"
            },
            {
              "attributed_to_ref": {
                "path": "characters/char-0265/index.json",
                "record_id": "char-0265"
              },
              "basis_refs": [],
              "certainty": "reported",
              "id": "claim-5322",
              "revealed_at": 144,
              "source_refs": [
                {
                  "anchor": "不到危急关头，还是不要运用此真法剑诀",
                  "chapter_id": "ch-000144",
                  "chapter_order": 144,
                  "path": "source/vol-004/ch-000144.txt"
                }
              ],
              "supersedes_refs": [],
              "text": "祠堂老人告诫林惊羽：此式真法剑诀刚猛至阳、威力虽大但大耗元气，不到危急关头不要运用。"
            },
            {
              "attributed_to_ref": null,
              "basis_refs": [],
              "certainty": "explicit",
              "id": "claim-5323",
              "revealed_at": 144,
              "source_refs": [
                {
                  "anchor": "林惊羽在他面前跪下",
                  "chapter_id": "ch-000144",
                  "chapter_order": 144,
                  "path": "source/vol-004/ch-000144.txt"
                }
              ],
              "supersedes_refs": [],
              "text": "林惊羽在祠堂老人面前跪下。"
            },
            {
              "attributed_to_ref": {
                "path": "characters/char-0002/index.json",
                "record_id": "char-0002"
              },
              "basis_refs": [],
              "certainty": "reported",
              "id": "claim-5324",
              "revealed_at": 144,
              "source_refs": [
                {
                  "chapter_id": "ch-000144",
                  "chapter_order": 144,
                  "path": "source/vol-004/ch-000144.txt"
                }
              ],
              "supersedes_refs": [],
              "text": "林惊羽恭声答「是，弟子知道了」。"
            },
            {
              "attributed_to_ref": {
                "path": "characters/char-0265/index.json",
                "record_id": "char-0265"
              },
              "basis_refs": [],
              "certainty": "reported",
              "id": "claim-5325",
              "revealed_at": 144,
              "source_refs": [
                {
                  "anchor": "总共传下了四式真法剑诀",
                  "chapter_id": "ch-000144",
                  "chapter_order": 144,
                  "path": "source/vol-004/ch-000144.txt"
                }
              ],
              "supersedes_refs": [],
              "text": "祠堂老人称：青云门内外只道「神剑御雷真诀」是无上真法，实则青叶祖师整理前辈祖师道法、又以自身从无名古卷领悟所得，共传下四式真法剑诀。"
            },
            {
              "attributed_to_ref": {
                "path": "characters/char-0265/index.json",
                "record_id": "char-0265"
              },
              "basis_refs": [],
              "certainty": "reported",
              "id": "claim-5326",
              "revealed_at": 144,
              "source_refs": [
                {
                  "anchor": "你师父也不知道的",
                  "chapter_id": "ch-000144",
                  "chapter_order": 144,
                  "path": "source/vol-004/ch-000144.txt"
                }
              ],
              "supersedes_refs": [],
              "text": "祠堂老人称林惊羽的师父苍松道人也不知道四式真法剑诀之事。"
            },
            {
              "attributed_to_ref": null,
              "basis_refs": [],
              "certainty": "explicit",
              "id": "claim-5327",
              "revealed_at": 144,
              "source_refs": [
                {
                  "anchor": "对这个老人的身分来历",
                  "chapter_id": "ch-000144",
                  "chapter_order": 144,
                  "path": "source/vol-004/ch-000144.txt"
                }
              ],
              "supersedes_refs": [],
              "text": "林惊羽对这位老人的身份来历多了几分好奇。"
            },
            {
              "attributed_to_ref": null,
              "basis_refs": [],
              "certainty": "explicit",
              "id": "claim-5328",
              "revealed_at": 144,
              "source_refs": [
                {
                  "anchor": "时候不早了，你先回去吧",
                  "chapter_id": "ch-000144",
                  "chapter_order": 144,
                  "path": "source/vol-004/ch-000144.txt"
                }
              ],
              "supersedes_refs": [],
              "text": "祠堂老人忽然眉头一皱，向远处望了一眼，随即以「时候不早了」为由让林惊羽先回去。"
            },
            {
              "attributed_to_ref": null,
              "basis_refs": [],
              "certainty": "explicit",
              "id": "claim-5329",
              "revealed_at": 144,
              "source_refs": [
                {
                  "anchor": "勉强填平",
                  "chapter_id": "ch-000144",
                  "chapter_order": 144,
                  "path": "source/vol-004/ch-000144.txt"
                }
              ],
              "supersedes_refs": [],
              "text": "林惊羽端端正正磕了三个头后离去；老人独自将隐秘处的符咒轻若无物般扫起，把石块填入深坑勉强填平，随后走回祖师祠堂大殿。"
            }
          ],
