                  "chapter_order": 144,
                  "path": "source/vol-004/ch-000144.txt"
                }
              ],
              "supersedes_refs": [],
              "text": "青龙见身下树林一处闪过一道紫芒、鲜血溅起、妖兽嘶吼，四面八方的妖兽向该处赶去，遂折返下去查看。"
            },
            {
              "attributed_to_ref": null,
              "basis_refs": [],
              "certainty": "explicit",
              "id": "claim-5349",
              "revealed_at": 144,
              "source_refs": [
                {
                  "anchor": "手中一件紫芒闪闪的法宝",
                  "chapter_id": "ch-000144",
                  "chapter_order": 144,
                  "path": "source/vol-004/ch-000144.txt"
                }
              ],
              "supersedes_refs": [],
              "text": "林中一名女子手持紫芒闪烁的法宝与无数妖兽厮斗，四处是四分五裂的妖兽尸体与鲜血。"
            },
            {
              "attributed_to_ref": {
                "path": "characters/char-0153/index.json",
                "record_id": "char-0153"
              },
              "basis_refs": [],
              "certainty": "reported",
              "id": "claim-5350",
              "revealed_at": 144,
              "source_refs": [
                {
                  "anchor": "你是金瓶儿",
                  "chapter_id": "ch-000144",
                  "chapter_order": 144,
                  "path": "source/vol-004/ch-000144.txt"
                }
              ],
              "supersedes_refs": [],
              "text": "青龙凭「紫芒刃」认出该女子，失声道「紫芒刃……你是金瓶儿？」。"
            },
            {
              "attributed_to_ref": {
                "path": "characters/char-0184/index.json",
                "record_id": "char-0184"
              },
              "basis_refs": [],
              "certainty": "reported",
              "id": "claim-5351",
              "revealed_at": 144,
              "source_refs": [
                {
                  "anchor": "金瓶儿落到青龙身边，冷然道",
                  "chapter_id": "ch-000144",
                  "chapter_order": 144,
                  "path": "source/vol-004/ch-000144.txt"
                }
              ],
              "supersedes_refs": [],
              "text": "金瓶儿落到青龙身边，冷然反问「你是谁？」。"
            },
            {
              "attributed_to_ref": {
                "path": "characters/char-0153/index.json",
                "record_id": "char-0153"
              },
              "basis_refs": [],
              "certainty": "explicit",
              "id": "claim-5352",
              "revealed_at": 144,
              "source_refs": [
                {
                  "anchor": "为什么不御空而起",
                  "chapter_id": "ch-000144",
                  "chapter_order": 144,
                  "path": "source/vol-004/ch-000144.txt"
                }
              ],
              "supersedes_refs": [],
              "text": "青龙心中奇怪，以金瓶儿此刻的道行为何不御空而起。"
            },
            {
              "attributed_to_ref": null,
              "basis_refs": [],
              "certainty": "explicit",
              "id": "claim-5353",
              "revealed_at": 144,
              "source_refs": [
                {
                  "anchor": "突然如潮水一般地退了下去",
                  "chapter_id": "ch-000144",
                  "chapter_order": 144,
                  "path": "source/vol-004/ch-000144.txt"
                }
              ],
              "supersedes_refs": [],
              "text": "无数妖兽突然如潮水般退去，森林深处涌来一股冰冷杀意，令青龙与金瓶儿这两个道行高深之人都打了冷战。"
            },
            {
              "attributed_to_ref": null,
              "basis_refs": [],
              "certainty": "explicit",
              "id": "claim-5354",
              "revealed_at": 144,
              "source_refs": [
                {
                  "anchor": "竟是个漂亮的几乎带着几分妖艳的少年",
                  "chapter_id": "ch-000144",
                  "chapter_order": 144,
                  "path": "source/vol-004/ch-000144.txt"
                }
              ],
              "supersedes_refs": [],
              "text": "前头一棵巨木背后人影闪动，走出一个身披鲜艳丝绸衣衫、黑发散落肩头、双手修长洁白、容貌俊美近乎妖艳的少年。"
            },
            {
              "attributed_to_ref": {
                "path": "characters/char-0153/index.json",
                "record_id": "char-0153"
              },
              "basis_refs": [],
              "certainty": "explicit",
              "id": "claim-5355",
              "revealed_at": 144,
              "source_refs": [
                {
                  "anchor": "在这个少年出现以后，竟有些微微的颤抖",
                  "chapter_id": "ch-000144",
                  "chapter_order": 144,
                  "path": "source/vol-004/ch-000144.txt"
                }
              ],
              "supersedes_refs": [],
              "text": "少年出现后，青龙感觉到身旁金瓶儿的身体竟有些微微的颤抖。"
            }
          ],
